Z||000006||Tigger||10-13-2000||09:04 AM||||I'm thinking the same way Standard is.  It would kind of give it a subtle look under the tinting.  Back window would be my next choice.<P>pHoOl, I don't have the address to the site but I thought I've seen a site pretty much dedicated to Fiero and Pontiac decals.  I'm sure they have the windshield decals.  Anyone have the link to that site?<P>Here's a link to the <A HREF="http://www.motorsportsdesigns.com/pontiacdecals.htm" TARGET=_blank>Offical Pontiac Decals Site</A>.  They have some pretty cool decals.<P>------------------<BR>T-T-F-N, Tah Tah For Now!<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/tigger.gif">           <BR>  <A HREF="mailto:RacingStripes@hotmail.com">RacingStripes@hotmail.com</A> ||||reg||1
